   "source": [
    "## Section 05 — Adaptive behaviour trajectories\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Do response patterns add information beyond the final score?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Streaks, recovery and stopping difficulty may reflect learning dynamics.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** clip_master order/timestamp\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Order validity check; streaks, recovery, early/late accuracy, difficulty and duration slopes, entropy, volatility.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `—`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** order_validity, trajectory_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Disabled with a reason if no reliable order exists.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Dataframe order is never used."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
