   "source": [
    "## Section 07 — Temporal and fluency intelligence\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Does response organisation predict later reading?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Fluency is a core reading component.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** clip_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Within-item correctness associations, item/student ICC, complexity and difficulty relations, student-level raw/residual/partial associations, complexity-duration surfaces, shrunk complexity sensitivity.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `short_pause_s, long_pause_s`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** temporal_family_report, complexity_sensitivity_estimates\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Initial silence is not a verified reaction time.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Observational."
   ]
  },
