   "source": [
    "## Section 08 — Spectral and spectrotemporal intelligence\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Do frequency-domain properties carry literacy signal?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Articulation precision may be visible spectrally.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** clip_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Same family engine for speech-active, full and background regions plus MFCC dynamics, controlling for quality.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `spectral_robust_stats, enable_hpss, enable_chroma`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** spectral_family_report\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Background-region features are negative controls.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Voice conversion may alter spectra."
   ]
