   "source": [
    "## Section 10 — Prosody and anonymisation robustness\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Which features survive voice conversion?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Anonymisation changes physiological voice measures.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** clip_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Prosody family analysis plus sensitivity classification of all clip features.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `enable_prosody, f0_*, sensitivity_*`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** prosody_family_report, anonymization_sensitivity\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** No identity, age, sex or medical inference.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Classification is heuristic."
