   "source": [
    "## Section 13 — Student-level aggregation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** How should clips become a student representation?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** The target is student-level; clips are not independent examples.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** clip tables, tabular features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Global/core robust stats, conditional (task, correctness, difficulty, complexity, quality, length, activity, stage, confidence), cross-task, contrasts, shrunk slopes, item-adjusted features, missingness indicators.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `aggregation_*, item_shrinkage_k, slope_shrinkage_k`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** student_features, aggregation_report\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** __diff= columns are EDA only.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Large feature space; selection must be nested."
