   "source": [
    "## Section 14 — Validation framework and screening baselines\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** How much variance does screening explain under honest CV?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Defines residuals and the reference for all deltas.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** screening_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Five CV schemes, M00–M06 models with in-pipeline preprocessing, pooled and mean-fold metrics, bootstrap CIs, school metrics, OOF residuals.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `cv_folds, cv_repeats, primary_baseline`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** cv_assignments, baseline_results, baseline_residuals\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Residual = observed − OOF screening prediction.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Unavailable schemes reported."
   ]
  },
