   "source": [
    "## Section 15 — Student phenotype atlas\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Are there distinct multimodal profiles?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Similar screening scores may hide different profiles.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** C01–C10 spaces, PCA, k-means/GMM/Ward/spectral/HDBSCAN, internal metrics, bootstrap ARI, composition, characterisation.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `cluster_*`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** cluster_assignments, cluster_evaluation, cluster_profiles\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Clusters never use the target.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Descriptive."
