   "source": [
    "## Section 16 — Residual signal discovery\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** What predicts outcome beyond screening?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Central scientific question.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features, baseline_residuals\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Raw/residual/partial correlations, adjusted cluster-robust regressions, FDR, cluster bootstrap, within-school permutations, held-out half replication, matched comparisons.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `fdr_alpha, discovery_*, matching_calipers, permutation_*`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** residual_associations, residual_family_ranking, matched_*\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Associations are not causal.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Selection optimism outside replication."
