   "source": [
    "## Section 17 — Confounding and robustness\n",
    "\n",
    "**Research question.** Are signals genuine or technical shortcuts?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Motivation.** Recording environment can leak outcome information.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inputs.** student_features, residuals\n",
    "\n",
    "**Methodology.** Negative controls NC01–NC07 (grouped shuffles), region comparisons, school separability, confound matrix, sign consistency, subgroup performance, generalisation gap.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configuration.** `min_group_size`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Outputs.** negative_controls, school_separability, confound_matrix\n",
    "\n",
    "**Interpretation.** Compare speech vs technical deltas.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations.** Speaker roles are not identified."
